STRING 39999
{
This release of the AI was made by |cffFF0000JoyJ|r. The original release was in Chinese and was ported to English by |cff0000FFJames Druid|r. This map is based on the DotA v6.78 AI map.
}
STRING 49998
{
Use the AI gold and experience bonus commands below to control how much money and experience computer players earn. The gold and experience adjustments can be used at the same time.

Experience adjustments:
|c00dd8dff Default |r: Based on difficulty, AI gains +20% / 45% / 80% extra experience.
|c00dd8dff-normexp (-ne) |r: AI no longer gains any extra experience.
|c00dd8dff-highexp (-he) |r: Based on difficulty, AI gains a higher experience bonus: +40% / 70% / 110%.
|c00dd8dff-dynaexp (-de) |r: Dynamic experience mode. Each AI's experience bonus grows over time, starting at (50 + 5 * number of human enemy players)% and rising every 3 minutes. If an AI has not killed an enemy hero, its bonus rate rises by an extra 17.5%. Each time an AI gets a kill or assist, its bonus rate drops by 33% / 25%. An AI can gain up to +200% extra experience in total.
Money adjustments:
|c00dd8dff Default |r: Based on difficulty, AI gains bonus gold every 7 seconds, plus a small amount of starting gold (0 / 4 / 8).
|c00dd8dff-normgold (-ng) |r: AI no longer gains any extra gold.
|c00dd8dff-highgold (-hg) |r: AI gains +8 gold every 7 seconds, and +10% starting gold.
|c00dd8dff-dynagold (-dg) |r: Dynamic gold mode. Each AI's gold rate grows over time, rising by +5 per 7 seconds every 3 minutes; if the AI has not killed an enemy hero, it rises by an extra +2.5 per 7 seconds (counting from the first 5 minutes of the game). Each time an AI gets a kill or assist, its gold rate drops by 33% / 25%. An AI can earn up to a maximum of 72 gold every 7 seconds.
The commands below combine several of the modes above:
|c00dd8dff-beginnermode (-bm) Novice Mode |r: same as normexp + normgold
|c00dd8dff-advancedmode (-am) Advanced Mode |r: same as normexp + normgold + dynaexp + dynagold
|c00dd8dff-xtrememode (-xm) Extreme Mode |r: same as normexp + normgold + dynaexp + dynagold, but the dynamic bonuses scale even higher.
}
STRING 49999
{
The AI script for this map was created mainly by Cloud_str, RGB and BuffMePlz. The PBMN and PlayDotA.com team have worked to improve and regularly update the DotA AI map, though most of the work was done by the original authors.

For AI map updates and development progress, see http://dota-pbmn.blogspot.com/ (Status: |cffFF0000Unknown / Missing in Action|r).

Note: Since 2014, the current AI maintainers are listed below. Visit the PlayDotA forums and open the AI thread, or check this site for updates: http://jamesdruid.blogspot.com/

Current AI Map Maintainers: |cffFF0000JoyJ|r and |cff0000FFJames Druid|r

The AI Map (v6.78) was made by PleaseBugMeNot (PBMN), Cloud_str, Ciel and the AI Team.

Very big thanks to |cffFF0000JoyJ|r for continuing development of the AI map. He completely restructured the map (from 6.78) and updated it to the latest DotA version (6.81).
}
